msgid ""
"To write a \"self-hosted\" package that can be downloaded by ``mip`` or "
"``mpremote``, you need a static webserver (or GitHub) to host either a "
"single .py file, or a ``package.json`` file alongside your .py files."
msgstr ""
"Untuk menulis paket \"self-hosted\" yang dapat diunduh oleh ``mip`` atau "
"``mpremote``\\ , Anda memerlukan server web statis (atau GitHub) untuk "
"menghost satu file .py, atau file ``package.json`` bersama file-file .py "
"Anda."

